{"Title":"An Act relative to the Community Preservation Trust Fund","BillNumber":"H414","DocketNumber":"HD2018","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"BHJ1","Name":"Bradley H. Jones, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BHJ1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T17:18:34.977"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"BHJ1","Name":"Bradley H. Jones, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BHJ1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T17:18:34.9766667"},{"Id":"FJB1","Name":"F. Jay Barrows","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/FJB1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-26T16:48:35.9166667"},{"Id":"NAG1","Name":"Nicholas A. Boldyga","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/NAG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-26T10:00:33.59"},{"Id":"KNF1","Name":"Kimberly N. Ferguson","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KNF1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T16:42:00.3466667"},{"Id":"PKF1","Name":"Paul K. Frost","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PKF1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T14:54:54.8933333"},{"Id":"JDM1","Name":"Joseph D. McKenna","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JDM1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-27T20:24:20.1533333"},{"Id":"SWG1","Name":"Susan Williams Gifford","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SWG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-26T16:27:56.2466667"},{"Id":"HEK1","Name":"Hannah Kane","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/HEK1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-30T15:45:55.5166667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H414/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Jones of North Reading, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 414) of Bradley H. Jones, Jr., and others relative to the Community Preservation Trust Fund.  Economic Development and Emerging Technologies.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 55 of chapter 23K of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking out, in subsection (c), the phrase “9 per cent” and replacing it with the following :- 4.5 per cent\r\n\tSECTION 2. Section 55 of said chapter 23K of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby further amended by adding, at the end of subsection (c), after the phrase “section 60” the following: - and 4.5 percent of its daily gross gaming revenue to the Community Preservation Trust Fund\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J12","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J12"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}